      "message": "test(heights): pin the setup-frame transform and the no-part refusal\n\nA setup tilted [90,0,0] with a vise reads the part's heights at\nZ -18..32 in its own frame. With only fixtures left, Top and Bottom of\nModel resolve to None, missing_source says \"no model loaded\", and\ngenerate refuses \"unresolved: no model loaded\". The collision pin also\nasserts that its no-vise control posts clean.\n\nRefs #1529\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
